[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4322.709, "timestamp": "01:12:02", "text": "旧版 3D。打扰一下。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4325.11, "timestamp": "01:12:05", "text": "就像那种全脸面膜，你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4328.87, "timestamp": "01:12:08", "text": "知道，就是白色的那一个。是的。是的。呃，你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4331.39, "timestamp": "01:12:11", "text": "我知道，那已经没了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4339.43, "timestamp": "01:12:19", "text": "它就这么自然地过渡到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4343.91, "timestamp": "01:12:23", "text": "过了一段时间后，就变成了一个蕾丝面具。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4346.99, "timestamp": "01:12:26", "text": "我的意思是，这样工作量少得多。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4350.709, "timestamp": "01:12:30", "text": "当你有嘴部动作时，不要让它动起来"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4361.91, "timestamp": "01:12:41", "text": "这个面具背后有什么故事？是吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4366.47, "timestamp": "01:12:46", "text": "呃，没有故事。我当时只是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4369.35, "timestamp": "01:12:49", "text": "我的天啊。我当时坐在房间里，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4371.83, "timestamp": "01:12:51", "text": "我当时就想，你知道，这是以前的事了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4375.189, "timestamp": "01:12:55", "text": "疫情期间，对吧？这是以前的样子"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4376.709, "timestamp": "01:12:56", "text": "我们被迫戴上了口罩。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4378.51, "timestamp": "01:12:58", "text": "感觉就像，我喜欢"}]